00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:53.530
So think of UPS' great big
fleet, or Coca-Cola, or Avis,

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.180
or places like that.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:58.840
Our fleet is bigger
than all of that.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:02.560
We are the purveyor of the
largest collections of arts

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:05.500
